{
"markdown": "### LiquidSiri\n\nGives Siri a brand-new look with the vibrant NewSiri glowing edge effect and the elegant frosted-glass SiriAI interface. The tweak customizes Siri's appearance smoothly while keeping the system's native recognition and conversation abilities intact.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/LiquidSiri/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/LiquidSiri/Screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 8,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **NewSiri glowing edge effect:** An impressive activation sweep, multicolor glowing edges and motion effects that react to your voice in a very lively way.\n- **SiriAI frosted-glass interface:** Comes with a glass orb and glass answer panel with flexible customization of position, size, corner radius and light refraction.\n- **Smart compatibility on iOS 18:** Avoids duplicating the system's native glowing edge effect; devices using the Siri orb can easily choose NewSiri.\n- **Multilingual:** Built-in English, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese in the settings.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
