"markdown": "### Version 1.1.4\n- Refined NewSiri's lighting and voice-response effects, making the activation animation and screen-edge transitions smoother.\n- The lighting effect now runs along the notch edge and the outer screen edge on Dynamic Island devices.\n- Fixed a crash when activating Siri on some iOS 15-17 devices and improved rendering compatibility for older systems.",
"useSpacing": true,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
